      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The words of Christ, which he spake unto his disciples, the twelve whom he had chosen, as he laid his hands upon them\u2014",
      "verse": "2:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 7.367,
      "end": 9.596,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he called them by name, saying:",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.776,
      "end": 13.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ye shall call on the Father in my name, in mighty prayer;",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 13.3,
      "end": 19.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after ye have done this ye shall have power that to him upon whom ye shall lay your hands,",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 19.842,
      "end": 21.746,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall give the Holy Ghost;",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 21.926,
      "end": 25.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in my name shall ye give it, for thus do mine apostles.",
      "verse": "2:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 26.182,
      "end": 30.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Christ spake these words unto them at the time of his first appearing;",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 30.96,
      "end": 33.236,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the multitude heard it not,",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 33.416,
      "end": 35.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the disciples heard it;",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 35.5,
      "end": 38.844,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and on as many as they laid their hands, fell the Holy Ghost.",
      "verse": "2:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    }
  ]
